# Secrets — never committed, matches the CLAUDE.md rule (never read/commit .env)
**/.env

# Virtual environments
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Experiment output — scratch, not a deliverable (see CLAUDE.md)
experiments/results/
**/logs/

# Generated data outputs (flow/) — regenerable from source via the build
# scripts (e.g. rules/build_instrument_master.py from NSE bhavcopy). Will
# grow large once real OHLCV data lands here too.
flow/data/

# Saved webpage page-chrome assets (logos, fonts, JS) from the Breeze doc
# dumps — some filenames are hex-encoded URLs that exceed the filesystem
# path-length limit. The actual documentation text lives inline in the
# .html files, not in these; safe to exclude.
**/*_files/
